#### 283\. 移动零
(https://leetcode.cn/problems/move-zeroes/) [[题型分类#单向快慢指针|快慢指针]] 两次遍历（但复杂度还是 n ）：
```cpp
class Solution {
public:
    void moveZeroes(vector<int>& nums) {
        int n = nums.size(), low = 0, fast = 0, count=0;
        while(fast < n){
            if(nums[fast] != 0){
                nums[low++] = nums[fast];
                count++;
            }
            fast++;
        }
        for (int i = count;i<n;i++){
            nums[i] = 0;
        }
    }
};
```
一次遍历（借助快速排序思想）
```cpp
class Solution {
public:
    void moveZeroes(vector<int>& nums) {
        int j = 0;
        for (int i = 0; i < nums.size();i++){
            if(nums[i]!=0){
                if(i>j){
                    nums[j] = nums[i];
                    nums[i] = 0;
                }
                j++;
            }
        }
    }
};
--------------也可以使用快慢指针--------------
class Solution {
public:
    void moveZeroes(vector<int>& nums) {
        int slow = 0;
        for (int fast = 0; fast < nums.size(); ++fast) {
            if (nums[fast] != 0) {
                swap(nums[slow], nums[fast]);
                slow++;
            }
        }
    }
};
```
核心思想是保证 low （j）指针左边的数字都非零，fast（i）指针遍历所有未知的元素

